    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we propose a new PFL algorithm called FedDWA (Federated Learning with Dynamic Weight Adjustment) to address the above problem, which leverages the parameter server (PS) to compute personalized aggregation weights based on collected models from clients.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:00d0986ca1bccc96995ffa0e0624acaf53f43809287e43918009fcaa0d3f1dc6",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "5f0073b3cdf58d6ac6d33f1a3ca663c8c3ad83098989665ae875fa348b2ad685",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:30.494934Z",
