      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409363354",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Community detection is a research hotspot in machine learning and data mining.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:65e8da8202655074fb4fa3623ec20bf9b994dc063163ebb4a1dde44a66ed140c",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "eeb9bcab4bb883404e53b730a2014d1494265482cd786965c56aba925d2c7351",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:24:39.077929Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:6975f77705ed80bdcf3d4cf9d37d5f7893f65204d2013880d950c7677f1dc10b#results[46];abstract[0:78]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3176096702",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Many data mining and analytical tasks rely on the abstraction of networks (graphs) to summarize relational structures among individuals (nodes).",
      "id": "evidence:topic:6caedcf891b64d78794c9cb354b1a4c2d49f7cb651013fbfbe35579baf6a928d",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "13c151fd9e4790771e43fbc6ebbe1a931146b070538602cc4bc064421ac9446a",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:56.286331Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:9f2d26fdd4af84afd63414673ee294e59ba6d63748e3b1d0bd941f623490a0e0#results[7];abstract[0:144]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3192690687",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We first present a graph construction method that robustly encodes periodic invariance and a strategy to capture angular information in neural networks without compromising efficiency.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:6eadaa31a3fb5d210a5ffc4d457432924e0c3517ec2a4b407afc7d3ed63b8068",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "760267b05d9ff93a19b1352f6f9dbcaa6f3f9c33c05344eb52926e6ecabe7704",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:27:14.275261Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:423c28d2f2c2e37dd1ecc9a371f2f0896ce44d713beab63cb9e9c69d96a23bd1#results[39];abstract[778:962]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4393158184",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "To address these problems, we propose a novel Communicative Subgraph representation learning for Multi-relational Inductive drug-Gene interactions prediction (CoSMIG), where the predictions of drug-gene relations are made through subgraph patterns, and thus are naturally inductive for unseen drugs/genes without retraining or utilizing external domain features.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:78ff66c258dafffa9a9157b9c723a4633681eaeda1e1183f35305cd630b4cd4a",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "73e2bf063462b221f4db074f96331ce94e8eefcac2c5976447178a194698d55a",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:14.938295Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:06287f797167047175047a5aba3c73a10770abcd83d647efce69b2e9dc0a6022#results[15];abstract[556:918]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4229033742",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we propose a novel model to learn Deep Hierarchical Attention-based Kernelized Representations (DHAKR) for graph classification.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:86c745f91c015966dd3ea0a9a32bd5332f1e702b0195c2e721009a71271622c9",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "dd02256a4c38e9b284608dad643f251dd59bd3a4a1a9ae0e7763fe6fb1dc6a05",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:22.052491Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:504995a3399fe7d165007e34e42dd5387fb57b16198c0adb93173270fcb19a88#results[29];abstract[78:221]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4409363523",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent researches abstract molecules as attributed graphs and employ graph neural networks (GNN) for molecular representation learning, which have made remarkable achievements in molecular graph modeling.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:8b6fa2eeaa340d5ea9150ee0cbc0052ed5417bf5579e47b2c751b07489db588e",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ff06d1ac9758308e9d9c446438ffd59512e85b019a621d31a203f2e31bb9c2a3",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:29:50.458970Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:3a74def3d95207a16576f6b35f0986661472be07a601fe83ecee17a003968dc0#results[7];abstract[144:348]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3190020173",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "We introduce word-level knowledge graphs (WKGs) to store short-term and long-term knowledge.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:93ca6714d3f258d5fc8aa77a45db0168bb6f48804d90204032f193029f5a53ba",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "72f08e8a224ad2745abcb830c41347694870aa89063c14947ab8989dc7018332",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:30:16.321114Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:91ab915b8c2b2660459451c613e67f978cc28b4316e0d4ab54670db871167a8d#results[38];abstract[517:609]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W3217011468",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Recent years have seen a surge in research on dynamic graph representation learning, which aims to model temporal graphs that are dynamic and evolving constantly over time.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a36c1305fa327e8289a61eec945b3274042c9260f9c73a72864cf358587cb513",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "9ec9475557942a1cc373a55dc0e0d7eec65b012da06a972d709df6dd4d5ec0d4",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:26:55.336525Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:919bee9b1aecdbe64ddab85604f170aaf3b9bc73a2ae426ebf221143c4fe2968#results[4];abstract[0:172]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4382464116",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "In this paper, we propose a family of novel Deep Hierarchical Transitive-Aligned Graph Kernels (DHTAGK) for graph classification.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:a45bb869058e1a62d605e5ac616444161957224c8baa904d730c502830dc0afc",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "ae1e14d9bf297eb2f69ad86bc9328b5f9ed5e9c2c6fcd266680ff58913110df3",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:06.039389Z",
      "source_locator": "openalex-request:dd2669bbe78b8fdbaf5b6b50d06b6856ca83d1a57b22d25dd62d930a822f125a#results[44];abstract[0:129]",
      "source_url": "https://openalex.org/W4414359956",
      "support_edge_ids": [],
      "support_paper_ids": []
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "Federated graph learning is focused on aggregating knowledge from multi-source graph data and training graph neural networks.",
      "id": "evidence:topic:ad94f45df1743a687b2fd1bf650c9895c641c9c6406c3e9a857e8c7076d3a68f",
      "kind": "inferred_topic",
      "raw_sha256": "cc9aeb5222573b8aff150b5e360d859f88818f0aa2c1e9a3cca70e3cacbde99d",
      "retrieved_at": "2026-11-07T20:31:12.240122Z",
